OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused said woman found in
OL,4,Afreezer had an accident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murdering a woman and
OL,7,Fhiding her body in a freezer for three
OL,8,Fyears told people she had an accident
OL,9,Fand fell into a coma, a court heard.
OL,11,FGeorge Gordon is accused of murdering
OL,12,Fhis friend Delia McInerney, 62, in
OL,13,FApril 2023, days before she was due to
OL,14,Fmove to Portugal for a "new life".
OL,16,FHer dismembered body was found in
OL,17,FGordon's flat in Gerards Court, St
OL,18,FHelens, Merseyside, along with her five
OL,19,Fdead guinea pigs, in January this year,
OL,20,FLiverpool Crown Court heard at his
OL,21,Fongoing trial.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
